      "displayedText": "Inter Galactic is a Matrix client. Messages, media, room membership, account details, and account deletion are primarily controlled by the homeserver selected by the user. End-to-end encrypted messages are designed so Inter Galactic and homeserver operators cannot read message contents. Calls are not end-to-end encrypted: audio and video are relayed by a call server that can access them. Metadata, push notification routing, backups, bridges, URL previews, GIF search, diagnostics, and third-party integrations can also involve separate services.",
